 "text": "49 occupied general seats, PP-151–PP-200, as of 2026-11-15. PP-171 is omitted because the assembly lists it as vacant or awaiting oath. PP-167 is updated to Malik Muhammad Shafee Khokhar, elected unopposed in a January 2026 by-election following Irfan Shafi Khokhar’s death; the assembly’s general directory still shows the deceased former member. For original 2024 members, term_start is given as 2024 where an individual commencement date was not verified."
